{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026V2EDVZ4Y7H1792965120.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：東北季候風會在今日影響廣東。而一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流會在本週中期逐漸影響華南沿岸，該區雲量稍多。隨著偏東氣流稍為緩和，本週後期廣東天色普遍晴朗，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約30度。吹和緩東至東北風。</p><p></p><p>展望：未來一兩日風勢較大，部分時間有陽光。本週後期天晴，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:40.925813+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:06.568937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:25.725021+00:00","content_hash":"2a4624c8db03547f5cca720c8af9dafefc1fc056aa259d65df8690433e28e920","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:40.925813+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}